Restricted sources
------------------

Two publishers reserve reproduction outright, so their control text is not in
this repository at all. Their parsed output is written to gitignored paths and
merged only into a local, untracked overlay
(`data/processed/licensed/all_controls.json`). The list lives in
`tract.config.RESTRICTED_FRAMEWORK_IDS` and is enforced by
`tests/test_licensed_text_not_tracked.py`.

  etsi        ETSI GR SAI 005 v1.1.1
  iso_27001   ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Annex A


